### Car Rental API: try it from Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code REST Client
@api = http://localhost:5080
@jnb = 8a1c9b52-4a8e-4f0e-9a51-0b7c1d2e3f01
@cpt = 8a1c9b52-4a8e-4f0e-9a51-0b7c1d2e3f02

### Branches (airports and city branches)
GET {{api}}/api/branches

### Availability (dates must be in the next 120 days)
GET {{api}}/api/availability?branchId={{jnb}}&pickupAt=2026-12-01T09:00:00%2B02:00&returnAt=2026-12-08T09:00:00%2B02:00

### Current terms (send its version back when booking)
# @name terms
GET {{api}}/api/terms/current

### Sign in as the development Gold customer (see appsettings.Development.json)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "gold@roam.test", "password": "Demo_Pass_123!" }

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### My profile (ID number comes back masked)
GET {{api}}/api/customers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Quote: 7-day SUV, one-way JNB -> CPT, GPS (Gold discount comes from the profile)
POST {{api}}/api/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Suv",
  "pickupBranchId": "{{jnb}}",
  "returnBranchId": "{{cpt}}",
  "pickupAt": "2026-12-01T09:00:00+02:00",
  "returnAt": "2026-12-08T09:00:00+02:00",
  "extras": "Gps"
}

### Tokenise a test card (mock hosted fields). The card number goes here and nowhere else.
# @name card
POST {{api}}/api/payments/tokenize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "number": "4242 4242 4242 4242", "expiry": "12/34", "cvc": "123" }

### Book it (authorises the quoted total on the card)
# @name book
POST {{api}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Suv",
  "pickupBranchId": "{{jnb}}",
  "returnBranchId": "{{cpt}}",
  "pickupAt": "2026-12-01T09:00:00+02:00",
  "returnAt": "2026-12-08T09:00:00+02:00",
  "acceptedTermsVersion": "{{terms.response.body.version}}",
  "extras": "Gps",
  "paymentToken": "{{card.response.body.token}}"
}

### Declined card -> 402 payment.declined (reason: card_declined), nothing booked
POST {{api}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Economy",
  "pickupBranchId": "{{jnb}}",
  "returnBranchId": "{{jnb}}",
  "pickupAt": "2026-12-01T09:00:00+02:00",
  "returnAt": "2026-12-02T09:00:00+02:00",
  "acceptedTermsVersion": "{{terms.response.body.version}}",
  "paymentToken": "tok_decline"
}

### Without accepting terms -> 422 terms.not_accepted
POST {{api}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Economy",
  "pickupBranchId": "{{jnb}}",
  "returnBranchId": "{{jnb}}",
  "pickupAt": "2026-12-01T09:00:00+02:00",
  "returnAt": "2026-12-02T09:00:00+02:00",
  "acceptedTermsVersion": null,
  "paymentToken": "tok_visa_approve"
}

### My bookings
GET {{api}}/api/reservations/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read it back (query side, owner only)
GET {{api}}/api/reservations/{{book.response.body.reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel
POST {{api}}/api/reservations/{{book.response.body.reservationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### =====================================================================================
### SIGN-UP WALKTHROUGH: register -> login -> profile -> terms -> card token -> book
### =====================================================================================

### 1. Register (change the email each run)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "new.driver@example.com", "password": "Roam_Test_123!" }

### 2. Log in
# @name newLogin
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "new.driver@example.com", "password": "Roam_Test_123!" }

@newToken = {{newLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Driver profile: test SA ID 9005105009088 (born 1990-05-10). 0308125800083 = 2003-08-12 (under 25).
PUT {{api}}/api/customers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{newToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Lerato",
  "lastName": "Dlamini",
  "phoneNumber": "+27 82 111 2222",
  "documentType": "SouthAfricanId",
  "documentNumber": "9005105009088",
  "issuingCountry": null,
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-10",
  "licenceIssuedOn": "2010-06-01"
}

### 4. Current terms
# @name newTerms
GET {{api}}/api/terms/current

### 5. Tokenise the Mastercard test card
# @name newCard
POST {{api}}/api/payments/tokenize
Authorization: Bearer {{newToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "number": "5555 5555 5555 4444", "expiry": "12/34", "cvc": "123" }

### 6. Book: 201 with payment.status "Authorized"
# @name newBooking
POST {{api}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{newToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Compact",
  "pickupBranchId": "{{jnb}}",
  "returnBranchId": "{{jnb}}",
  "pickupAt": "2026-12-10T09:00:00+02:00",
  "returnAt": "2026-12-13T09:00:00+02:00",
  "acceptedTermsVersion": "{{newTerms.response.body.version}}",
  "extras": "None",
  "paymentToken": "{{newCard.response.body.token}}"
}

### =====================================================================================
### STAFF (Agent role)
### =====================================================================================

### Sign in as the development agent
# @name agentLogin
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "agent@roam.test", "password": "Demo_Pass_123!" }

@agentToken = {{agentLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Who am I? -> roles ["Agent"]
GET {{api}}/api/account/me
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### Pickups at JNB on a day (SAST)
GET {{api}}/api/agent/branches/{{jnb}}/pickups?date=2026-12-10
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### Returns due at JNB by the end of a day (late ones have isLate = true)
GET {{api}}/api/agent/branches/{{jnb}}/returns?date=2026-12-13
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### Find any booking by id (or ROAM-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX)
GET {{api}}/api/agent/reservations/{{newBooking.response.body.reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### Register a walk-in customer: the temporary password comes back ONCE
POST {{api}}/api/agent/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "walk.in@example.com",
  "firstName": "Sipho",
  "lastName": "Mokoena",
  "phoneNumber": "+27 83 222 3333",
  "documentType": "Passport",
  "documentNumber": "A1234567",
  "issuingCountry": "GBR",
  "dateOfBirth": "1987-03-14",
  "licenceIssuedOn": "2007-05-01"
}
